      "writtenOn": "2026-08-19T21:45:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we have to keep the same field type and use type casts: https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/4214726/3?  It seems ridiculous, but it seems to be the only solution that is general enough to work for all three of the fixes that need to be backported.",
      "parentUuid": "7d9d12a5_c1104a4a",
      "revId": "786c76c6bcad2ed54c8549a59780221c2ec8208e",
